# Beacon Cursor Agent Surface

- Beacon skills are materialized under `.cursor/skills/`.
- Use `beacon <subcommand>` as the stable local execution surface.
- Treat `docs/beacon/global-boundaries.md` and `docs/beacon/<version>/` as canonical truth.
- Refresh with `beacon doctor setup-agent-surface --project-root . --agent cursor`.
- Verify with `beacon doctor verify-agent-surface --project-root . --agent cursor --strict`.

